{"ID":"20240314091829-6517b7s","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091829-6517b7s","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091829-6517b7s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170658-71hlfs7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170658-p54bye8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1476,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170658-p54bye8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【胶艾汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170859"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170658-71hlfs7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-71hlfs7","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"师曰：妇人有漏下者，有半产后因续下血都不绝者，有妊娠下血者，假令妊娠腹中痛，为胞阻，胶艾汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-n4r827d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-n4r827d","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胶艾汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-5bu3qrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-5bu3qrw","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"干地黄六两、川芎阿胶甘草各二两、艾叶当归各三两、芍药四两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-g0tirc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-g0tirc9","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右七味，以水五升，清酒三升，合煑，取三升，去滓，内胶令消尽，温服三升，日三服，不差更作。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-c0ypr6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-c0ypr6u","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"介绍这个条辩之前呢，大家要有个概念，这样子看就很清楚了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-kfuygn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-kfuygn9","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240412164933-wzsyylm.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-w79fdgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-w79fdgx","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内经呢，它说脾主腹，也就是说少腹，肚子这边呢脾脏在管，那中医的观点里面，脾是统血，血脏！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以妇人子宫怀孕一定跟脾脏的运化有关系"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，对不对？所以说一个人如果怀孕很正常，她是这样子，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"没有怀孕的时候吃饭很正常，哪天一怀孕的时候，奇怪，怎么胃口那么大，一天可以吃好几餐？就是一个人吃两人补啊，因为脾的运化很强啊。这是一个血的来源"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二个血的来源呢，肝脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！因为全身呢只有肝经经络络过子宫，还有呢，我们的肝经到头顶上去，所以我们的吴茱萸，有没有？我们在介绍吴茱萸汤的时候，病人头痛，强烈的恶心，吴茱萸汤主之。吴茱萸汤里面有生姜啊，可以去恶心。那如果是血跑到子宫里面来，我们也会想到是肝的问题啊。所以我们就可以知道"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怀孕的时候有肝还有脾两个脏在协调供血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小baby 在妈妈肚子里面的时候，就是由脾脏和肝脏两个脏在养他"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这是中医的观念。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-3te6syt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-3te6syt","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个条辩呢啊，有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四个症状"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"妇人有漏下者，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怀孕中间有流血下来，；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二个"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"有半产后因续下血都不绝者，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妇人流产以后不停地继续下血啊；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第三个"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"有妊娠下血者"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有怀孕中间流血者；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第四个"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"假令妊娠腹中痛"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个怀孕中间肚子痛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这四大症状就是我们现在要介绍的胶艾汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-8k7jq6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-8k7jq6j","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个胶艾汤，你拿到手上这个处方呢...这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人常常滴漏不止，没有怀孕都常常出血，不正常地出血，也可以用胶艾汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；还有流产，本来怀孕 3 个月，3 个月后流产了，或者 2 个月，有的人一个多月就流产了，我有病人怀孕 5 次就流产5次，没有一次例外，就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只要怀孕就会流产，胶艾汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；那还有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怀孕中间流血，胎儿还没有流啊，出血，也是胶艾汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。还有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怀孕的时候肚子痛，也是胶艾汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-3n1amep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-3n1amep","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说很多地方这个胶艾汤都可以用，为什么？因为脾脏跟肝脏...脾主运化啊，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果说一个人肝脾两虚，当这两个脏都虚的时候，这个血没有办法固在子宫里面，血就会漏出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-ao6lwmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-ao6lwmw","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们回头看胶艾汤，用胶艾汤处方的时候啊，诸位不要干地黄6两啊，用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生地黄 1 两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。川芎、阿胶，这个甘草呢，我们是这样子...一般来说，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"川芎是用5钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阿胶、甘草各 3 钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，待会儿会介绍为什么会这样子，然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"艾叶，当归也是 3 钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白芍呢大概是 4 钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果说肚子疼得厉害，白芍用 5 钱、6钱都没有关系，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个药用生地黄的原因是什么？因为补血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。真正在补血的药靠的是生地黄，不是当归。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归它可以补血的原因是什么呢，因为当归里面有油脂，这个吃下到肚子里面以后，因为油会滑利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"...你如果今天回家什么都不要吃，你就吃当归，吃当归就拉肚子，为什么？因为当归里面的油脂会把里面的宿便统统排掉，排掉以后你就会肚子饿啊，会吃新的东西，所以当归补血。但"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真正补血的是地黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你看那个地黄黑黑的，软软的，那是真正的补血，里面很多的铁，很多的对血非常好的东西。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"川芎呢，活血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以如果说一个人腹痛，比如说肚子痛得很厉害，你用川芎下去...老师，月经痛，那个肚子痛得很厉害，我们可以用吴茱萸，对不对？吴茱萸当然可以呀，那这个人头痛，也可以用川芎跟吴茱萸。那这只是这个药我们说可以把血管打开来，让血进去，里面真的有淤血的时候，你可以加一些茜草啊，一些丹皮、桃仁啊活血化瘀的药在里面啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-4ys85q9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-4ys85q9","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样子，那这个艾草出现的时候，我们在针灸的‘灸’里面，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们用艾草去灸，为什么？因为艾是阳，能够行气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以艾叶我们直接放到汤药里面去煮的时候哦，能够活络我们的血脉神经啊，所以艾叶是非常好的活血化瘀的一种药。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阿胶呢，为什么3钱？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为我们一般来说呢，9 碗水煮成 3 碗，那 9 碗的时候，它有部分酒，比如水有 6 碗，清酒3碗，酒放下去煮..."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中医药中医用酒下药的时候，因为酒呢能够升提、生发，所以说你这些补药在里面，如果用酒去一煮的时候，我们人能吸收的很快"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，吸收的非常快啊，所以说你这个 6碗水 3 碗酒进去煮，或者你说老师，这个人喝下去醉了，对不对？其实你煮过以后，酒精已经很少了。可是你遇到个太太呢是一杯就倒了的，你给她 8 碗水1碗酒嘛，你可以自己去调配嘛，不要那么死脑筋。这个药要用酒去烧效果最好。当你遇到个女的是个酒鬼，好爽啊！我 8 碗酒 1 碗水也可以呀，对吧！看她喜欢，她很爽就好了啊，那她能够吞下去最重要啊！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那阿胶是不能煮的啊，阿胶是汤好了以后，关火冲进去的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那分3服，因为3付那每次就是 1 钱的阿胶，所以阿胶3钱分3包，把它打碎啊，要吃之前呢倒下去，让它融化掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-ibc6wiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-ibc6wiv","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个处方呢是针对病人腹中痛，肝脾两虚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以这个人一定是气色黄白啊，精神不好，里面是血虚的状态时用的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-ta5em0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-ta5em0y","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"滴漏脉20240412_172422"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/滴漏脉20240412_172422-20240412172451-1x6lxy3.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-wkpi5hv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-wkpi5hv","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看这四大症状都可以用这个胶艾汤。在这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脈经"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"里有提到漏下的脉，你一摸她的脉，你说哎你滴漏，医生你好厉害，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你怎么知道我滴漏？寸脉能摸出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你摸她的寸脉的时候，本来是手臂是这样啊，这是寸的位置，结果脉来你摸她是，跳跳，两边都换着跳。本来我们脉是一条嘛，对不对？她的脉是一下跳这边一下跳那边，轮流着跳（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如图"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），因为阳没有办法守住，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳虚嘛，阳没有办法守住，阴就一直往下漏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以阳很强的时候，寸脉就比较是直的，就像跷跷板一样，尺脉会比较低一点，寸脉会比较高一点，直直的一条。那左右两边跳的时候，阳气就虚掉了，血就会漏下来。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-k1j6b7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-k1j6b7v","updated":"20240422170658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个药下去呢，这个止血呢瞬间就止掉了，很快！中药去止血的话，大家相信啊，这个比西医王道多了。你如果不懂得这个胶艾汤怎么用，那这个怀孕中间出血的时候或者是你平常没有怀孕你也常常出血的时候，结果啊开刀进去吧子宫、卵巢拿掉，真是划不来啊，不需要。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170658-p54bye8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170658-p54bye8"}}]}